{"id":28636,"author":"poofywoo","body":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eIGN: ChristmasPoofy (poofywoo)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eDiscord( Name#): poofy#0085\u003cbr\u003eTimezone: NZDT (gmt+13?)\u003cbr\u003eAny previous Ref experience?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eI am currently a ref on the Stratus Network, and have somewhat understanding of reffing. No experience on Avicus.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy would you like to join the referee team:\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003eI would like to join, because I think it will be fun and a pleasant experience. As events are seasonal, I want to ref as much as possible. Reffing is very fun, and I think it would be nice to ref an Avicus tournament.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eAre you able to commit to Saturday Tournaments, and occasionally event staff meetings?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eI am able to commit to Saturday tournaments and meetings. (Although not able on Sundays)\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA paragraph or two to tell us something about yourself:\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003ei like to think of myself as a cool cucumber. I like to have fun and meet new people, and I think being a ref will help that.\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnything else?:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eI couldn't think of anything and I know mods can read this so I wanted to keep it like not cringe\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eIGN: ChristmasPoofy (poofywoo)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u0